>How can you tell if food is tainted?

It's tainted some 50 turns after killing it. If you're not sure, dont
eat it or make sure you have a non-cursed unicorn horn handy.

>How many entrances to the Mines are there?

One.

>What should you not eat (like humans and pets), and why not?

Get a decent spoiler file from ftp.krl.caltech.edu and see for
yourself. The answer is too long to post over and over again if anyone
can ftp it themselves.

>What is the point of carrying gems?

It is one of the few things that counts for your score and you can also
throw them at a coaligned unicorn to increase your luck.

>How do you get Dragon Scale armor?

Kill dragon, be lucky that they leave scales, wear scales, read scroll.
Or wish.

>What creatures should you not kill (like guards), and why not?

Peaceful or tame creatures should not be killed. Any other may be
killed without penalty.

>How can you tell if your god is pissed at you?

Offer. If you have "a hopeful feeling" you may NOT pray yet (you can
only hope for better times).

